# Malformed atom types: one atom with a bare element (no dot), one with an unknown type,
# one with a valid element prefix but unrecognised hybridization tag.
# Demonstrates: stored-and-logged posture for unrecognised SYBYL types.
@<TRIPOS>MOLECULE
bad_types
 4 3 0 0 0
SMALL
NO_CHARGES

@<TRIPOS>ATOM
      1 C1          0.0000    0.0000    0.0000 C       1 LIG 0.000
      2 N1          1.4000    0.0000    0.0000 N.bogus  1 LIG 0.000
      3 O1          2.1000    1.1200    0.0000 O.3     1 LIG 0.000
      4 Br1         3.5000    1.1200    0.0000 Br      1 LIG 0.000
@<TRIPOS>BOND
     1     1     2    1
     2     2     3    2
     3     1     4    1
